    {
      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "DECISION-RULES",
      "narration_text": "Field five is the one most people skip: decision rules. What does Cowork do when two sources contradict each other? When a number is ambiguous? When a section is missing entirely? Without decision rules, Cowork resolves conflicts silently using its own judgment — and you find the error in the output, not in a warning.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "REMOTION",
        "source": "own",
        "motion": "callout-reveal",
        "media": "media/B03.mp4",
