        "filled_by": "manim:B03_ClaudeLiamSeven",
        "at": "2026-08-10T04:02:29"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B04",
      "act": "STOP-CONDITIONS",
      "narration_text": "Field seven: stop conditions. What should Cowork do when a source is missing, a file is inaccessible, or a number does not add up? The answer is always: pause and report, not guess and continue. Stop conditions are the brief's safety valve — the instruction Cowork follows when things go wrong.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "REMOTION",
        "source": "own",
        "motion": "callout-reveal",
